NInfer RTX 4090 deployment overlay

This repository contains deployment scripts, documentation, and a source patch
for the NInfer engine. It does not contain model weights or compiled binaries.
Model weights remain subject to the Qwen model card and the artifact
publisher's terms; they are not redistributed here.

